date-released: "2026-10-29"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/DrAdedamola/clinical-lab-aerosol-biorisk-reference"
keywords:
  - biorisk management
  - clinical laboratory
  - infectious aerosol
  - laboratory-acquired infection
  - ISO 35001
  - biosafety cabinet
  - evidence grading
  - sentinel laboratory
abstract: >-
  An open, procedure-level scoring instrument applying biorisk assessment,
  characterization and evaluation reasoning to individual bench steps in routine
  clinical diagnostic testing, mapped to the clause structure of ISO 35001:2019,
  together with reference scores, evidence grades and recommended control sets for
  seven bench steps that can generate infectious aerosols.
